  "title": "India vs Afghanistan T20I Series in New Delhi",
  "summary": "Sony Sports Network has acquired exclusive TV broadcast rights for the upcoming three-match T20I series between India and Afghanistan, starting September 13, followed by the second and third matches on September 15 and 17. The series will be streamed live at the Arun Jaitley Stadium in New Delhi.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Sony Sports Network has acquired exclusive television broadcast rights for the Afghanistan-India T20I series.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The series will be streamed live on SonyLIV platforms with key highlights including a critical Test Day 3 where India's bowler Suriya Siraj made an early run for two runs.",
